          {
            "title": "Saving negation",
            "id": 62038,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos guardar una negación completa en otra variable, también.</p><p>Crea la variable <code>isEvening</code> y usa <code>!</code> para cambiar <code>isMorning</code> a <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isMorning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isEvening = !isMorning;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isEvening);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>isEvening</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y luego <code>!</code>, <code>isMorning</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos guardar una negación completa en otra variable, también.</p><p>Niega la variable <code>isMorning</code> en <code>isEvening</code> y muestra <code>isEvening</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isMorning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isEvening = !isMorning;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isEvening);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"isAfternoon\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!!\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>isEvening</code> seguido de <code>=</code>, <code>!</code>, <code>isMorning</code> y finalmente <code>isEvening</code>.</p></body></html>",
