            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una constante llamada <code>isAvailable</code> que guarde el valor contrario de <code>openSlot</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" openSlot = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isAvailable = !openSlot;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"isOpen\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>const</code> seguido de <code>isAvailable</code>, <code>!</code> y finalmente <code>openSlot</code>.</p></body></html>",
